msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Open your eyes, Michel..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……请睁开双眼……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_48E6AEA3_0DED_43F0_B258_194591F5F3CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
