#: scenario9:scenario9_BFFABA15_63BD_40FC_B8ED_40BF543856FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddab5c7fde953e45d446bd5e7c83e87804e111e1422d54deb7393718a036fa3f
