msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario9:scenario9_EEB2D58B_2A68_4E9C_8379_91E1270DF884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47820999b4651b79751df9230a5a9649e2ac0283938e0a26ccc75f371dda6374
#. default-sha256: f0d1759707b8e74aa9dc6a6b7f619b3285986b31601faa24f1b8110f55bbbe78
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_EEB2D58B_2A68_4E9C_8379_91E1270DF884"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why are you acting... ⟪k:1⟫like it’s all your fault?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为什么……⟪k:1⟫要这么说……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_DF5DEAFE_AB08_4F9A_BCBA_1DA2539EC800
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e48516430e849cacaf7db2a3f36356b97a4bad4811f604b7a551eef79abbb3b0
#. default-sha256: 487e347b19cab09438826405267954ee5e5aea1df498471713d6fc14d610c412
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_DF5DEAFE_AB08_4F9A_BCBA_1DA2539EC800"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you trying to say everyone would be better off without you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你是想说……⟪k:1⟫自己不存在才好是吗……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_924BB831_2A65_4066_B6DF_6B5AF8268651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 958cabedd7fbd6171e7a9f4c91d47bfb3814da06c1f2203b8b548ca1cc80f3d8
#. default-sha256: 7d415274b78a6ef6a625579858c1086705a7471f2351d4a4a5e3f72146209959
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_924BB831_2A65_4066_B6DF_6B5AF8268651"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Like hell you were."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫简直……⟪k:1⟫荒谬之极……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_B139A233_E70D_4F3B_8565_A51B4A55377C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca328134f98552bcaa25518f3ff1fc3d5f7a0c0ffe665e1786afa29a35e7093b
#. default-sha256: 94818fa84f5699ad67180821b16c9b6f6587f594a04e94baeef7424a1e8b3883
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_B139A233_E70D_4F3B_8565_A51B4A55377C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was born to be a receptacle for her pain, to ease her suffering."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我作为承担她的伤痛、⟪k:1⟫缓解她的痛苦的存在，⟪k:2⟫而被创造出来。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_8EC6D6CB_F486_41D7_BCDE_441BCF502863
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4a6cc328bc056add9c88a32c2c38772ab76db47cf12aeb05e0db3ccb7a2202c
#. default-sha256: 09ebc50a037732ce68874a3168dd0ec6c2c3af9aa816513afb646e66682e1532
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_8EC6D6CB_F486_41D7_BCDE_441BCF502863"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That was not how she felt deep down, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She was not a saint out of the "
"goodness of her heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可这些事情——⟪k:1⟫并非出自她本身的善良，⟪k:2⟫甚至并非出自她的本心。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_27B4F3AD_B200_46E0_9E39_760FA23116D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da6a77c850aa0d836446177fbc516b5f0b233eb48add868e1bc4820f7b5aba0a
#. default-sha256: 685a53869d4c79b0ab1b5448bdf8a32d27e2e20771332135afcaee39bb308f66
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_27B4F3AD_B200_46E0_9E39_760FA23116D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So she took all her “saintly” characteristics and gave them to me—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫caring for "
"others, putting herself second, being forgiving—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫所以……⟪k:1⟫她将那些为他人着想的温柔、⟪k:2⟫牺牲精神，⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫还有对他人的宽容……一切圣女所应"
"有的品质……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_300588D5_5543_4925_9C59_B86D0CDF8E42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaba99fb8f61b15b1bb78a50050be88237b14498235dc75515ae9eb74cbb18be
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_300588D5_5543_4925_9C59_B86D0CDF8E42"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario9:scenario9_AA49492A_FB24_4BEB_8A11_1B6DE71754A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc800bfd7725db9e8ca74224a7ed31c219dbb30d3aa2804d5ea122f15068697d
#. default-sha256: 70db45bba9798ef5b7a4d86255ad5b815db69b6a220e00c34b83795ea46af69f
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_AA49492A_FB24_4BEB_8A11_1B6DE71754A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In a world where I was never meant to exist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这是……⟪k:1⟫不该有的事情。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_82D5CD06_EFF9_4E8C_BF26_7855E821AEAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf98cb7c3c5e0bb8824b039b1f804a9305c10c5829fd0edfe6f9d6edd192422b
#. default-sha256: a22cf26ef70a1248986151722211a9cb196c258b8d9bbb1353f21ed87d46857b
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_82D5CD06_EFF9_4E8C_BF26_7855E821AEAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and Morgana wished to curse the three men’s souls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而莫尔加娜的愿望是，⟪k:1⟫诅咒那三位男性的灵魂。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D3FF89B2_C0DD_42E7_9E15_DDDEC5A0FD03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 958a68c2b82c9b6a9d52f2bb87f5187344004df67059a0b57c6c8668b358d5c9
#. default-sha256: a9a6fd352bf6a898bac586684f0f9a5b2ad05a5de3898441debdf3b44a10e3c5
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D3FF89B2_C0DD_42E7_9E15_DDDEC5A0FD03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In order for an incomplete soul like mine to survive, it needs something to bind itself to "
"the world—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫something strong enough to prevent the universe from “correcting” the anomaly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我作为灵魂是不完整的存在。⟪k:1⟫如果像我这样的异物想存在下去，⟪k:2⟫就需要拥有强大力量之物把我"
"与这个世界连结起来。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_26C22C6F_3835_4C3F_BA35_F932EDDE9DE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23736d21ccd282964e682e0cb39994b9fb55c8fb4ad745043dac8b2e31c06170
#. default-sha256: 59b12a1c1bb91596f0764eba9de51ab17136f6890a3f766df58f229db12e9ba4
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_26C22C6F_3835_4C3F_BA35_F932EDDE9DE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so the wish of that anomaly... ⟪k:1⟫gave birth to yet another anomaly—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我偏离了世界常理，⟪k:1⟫我的愿望果不其然催生了偏离世界常理之物。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D21274E5_3971_4179_BCFE_1CCDE07DEAD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26072ba5b2a26ea31c7e28b0d9ee5af22edd1ff6e37e5d863dbf89c751e96053
#. default-sha256: 0b8186756abb7502b3c8ea38dcdf8afc0c65fb26e0df6c88f8bf9b70c604e5d9
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D21274E5_3971_4179_BCFE_1CCDE07DEAD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫a house that sat outside the currents of time.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫One that could descend into the "
"mortal realm at various times and places."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫超越了时间与空间，⟪k:1⟫出现在现实中，⟪k:2⟫无视时间流逝的馆……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_7B0EB139_01EE_4014_9911_2C1CB1F186DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ef0525a68ae72f6cd1197b2b7542d0fec61e81263c64746e44a065b1220ad36
#. default-sha256: 62300af082ca38ef2f70bdbc0554f6aa7cda3a71c56b62e89d0384cef81f608f
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_7B0EB139_01EE_4014_9911_2C1CB1F186DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And why did it have to be that house that bound me to the world?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为何只有馆才能将我与这个世界连结呢……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_A9956F34_AC58_4FD8_AAB2_17ADFA21C0EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaba99fb8f61b15b1bb78a50050be88237b14498235dc75515ae9eb74cbb18be
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_A9956F34_AC58_4FD8_AAB2_17ADFA21C0EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario9:scenario9_3D76D3F0_B785_4847_BC7D_4F8DC241C59C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68d4bd019240c16dea57897d7f40189817c775333ab5fa6200b5f6b482202acb
#. default-sha256: 9461307d22271cacf51c7f1abaf87a8206b3be8742d568033fe24fa9512d0667
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3D76D3F0_B785_4847_BC7D_4F8DC241C59C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My very presence malevolent."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我的存在本身……⟪k:1⟫就是罪孽。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_77583269_3E0D_416C_A4DD_9CEC53949443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d4d7eed5f22299f64904840a5f881c2ca0777580aefd0df96030acb5bc5064c
#. default-sha256: 39c2284f81988ecd006112d7f2b79afc0d9bc279b7a5ca2c55cee998891ecf8c
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_77583269_3E0D_416C_A4DD_9CEC53949443"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, stop..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……请别再说了……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_4FA002B7_F14F_45BB_A19E_6A99E0CF9FDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce2e87564ca9ffc8342515f759a4a20c8ba3b324c6ac6dc663ca212424b90d65
#. default-sha256: e1c0be10f70d4fc5ad4f8f5e8596ea9f1b186faa8280930ba534828fe0878051
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4FA002B7_F14F_45BB_A19E_6A99E0CF9FDA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The universe must be returned to its proper state, Michel."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以，⟪k:1⟫米歇尔……⟪k:2⟫必须要让世界之理回归正常。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_4DECEAE2_970C_4CD6_BDDF_DE47457B4E9A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a5d059013f06716aa809a196a8aa519706b2ed739f3a0ef4db693669f9c80b0
#. default-sha256: 95136d90fff49345ec2d384353a5be3e96cab662e7d4d864fe273298d81b9baf
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4DECEAE2_970C_4CD6_BDDF_DE47457B4E9A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t talk about yourself like that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……不要……⟪k:1⟫再用这样的语气……⟪k:2⟫说下去了……"

#: scenario9:scenario9_A9F321DC_32EA_49D0_A6B0_F157BEECC80C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a84920df8b92aaaba3474344fcc59fca0ff763603442cb4714405fef7fbf0485
#. default-sha256: b38e6ed9e8bfbc57b5ba3e74fad8f371778f0c9e07644f4fffe4f3ba632c474a
